    "title": "Wing Fighter",
    "description": "Wing Fighter is a free classic arcade online shooting game, with epic 3D realistic scenes, gorgeous and fascinating combat effects and a variety of unique bosses and equipment. If you loved arcade shooting games as a kid, this retro game blend with modern combat styles would be the perfect game for you!\r\n\r\nIn every battle of Wing Fighter, You will become an air force pilot, controlling different fighters to fight evil enemies and bosses. It is your mission to defeat them and protect the safety and freedom of the skies! Enemies have invaded and the battle is on the verge of breaking out. Come on and start this thrilling combat flight action game now!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Shoot down enemy fighters, challenge powerful and diverse ultimate bosses.\r\n- Enrich your equipment arsenal with hundreds of options to choose from, turning your fighter into a flying tank.\r\n- Clone skill, furious mode, damage bonus...Choose strong fighters with multiple additional attributes as you wish!\r\n- Hundreds of combat buffs. Different buffs and attack strategies create different combat experiences.\r\n- Complete the mission and unlock battle scenes and levels.\r\n- Select multiple activity patterns from normal to nightmare.\r\n- Improve fighter power, fight your way to the top of the Leaderboard!\r\n- Complete daily missions to gain resources; lots of rewards are waiting for you.\r\n- Choose your favorite pilots and assign them tasks.\r\n- Mysterious talent system that combines Roguelike elements to increase combat power permanently.\r\n- Challenge the limits and win big prizes in the 'Endless Voyage' event.\r\n- Easy to pick up and play, no complicated tutorials required!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the classic thrilling combat flight action game - Wing Fighter. Don\u2019t let the enemy conquer your freedom, shoot and be ready to attack right now!\r\nDOWNLOAD AND PLAY IT FOR FREE!\r\n\r\nContact us: wszj6868@gmail.com\r\nJoin us on Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/WingFighterOfficial\r\nJoin Discord to get support: https://discord.gg/2WaJZbqFAy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Wing Fighter is a free classic arcade online shooting game, with epic 3D realistic scenes, gorgeous and fascinating combat effects and a variety of unique bosses and equipment. If you loved arcade shooting games as a kid, this retro game blend with modern combat styles would be the perfect game for you!<br><br>In every battle of Wing Fighter, You will become an air force pilot, controlling different fighters to fight evil enemies and bosses. It is your mission to defeat them and protect the safety and freedom of the skies! Enemies have invaded and the battle is on the verge of breaking out. Come on and start this thrilling combat flight action game now!<br><br>Features:<br>- Shoot down enemy fighters, challenge powerful and diverse ultimate bosses.<br>- Enrich your equipment arsenal with hundreds of options to choose from, turning your fighter into a flying tank.<br>- Clone skill, furious mode, damage bonus...Choose strong fighters with multiple additional attributes as you wish!<br>- Hundreds of combat buffs. Different buffs and attack strategies create different combat experiences.<br>- Complete the mission and unlock battle scenes and levels.<br>- Select multiple activity patterns from normal to nightmare.<br>- Improve fighter power, fight your way to the top of the Leaderboard!<br>- Complete daily missions to gain resources; lots of rewards are waiting for you.<br>- Choose your favorite pilots and assign them tasks.<br>- Mysterious talent system that combines Roguelike elements to increase combat power permanently.<br>- Challenge the limits and win big prizes in the &#39;Endless Voyage&#39; event.<br>- Easy to pick up and play, no complicated tutorials required!<br><br>Enjoy the classic thrilling combat flight action game - Wing Fighter. Don\u2019t let the enemy conquer your freedom, shoot and be ready to attack right now!<br>DOWNLOAD AND PLAY IT FOR FREE!<br><br>Contact us: wszj6868@gmail.com<br>Join us on Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/WingFighterOfficial<br>Join Discord to get support: https://discord.gg/2WaJZbqFAy",
